[7] I'm going to tell you a story that's all about love... for dogs! 

Once upon a time, in a cozy little town surrounded by rolling hills and green forests, there lived a dog named Max. Max was a big, fluffy golden retriever with a heart of gold, and a tongue that was always lolling out of his mouth, giving him a perpetually happy look.

Max loved nothing more than spending his days lounging in the sun-drenched backyard of his best friend, a little girl named Lily. Lily was a shy, gentle soul with a love for all things canine, and she and Max were inseparable.

Together, they'd go on long walks, play hide-and-seek, and even cuddle up on the couch for movie nights. Max was always by Lily's side, and she knew that no matter what, he'd always be there to lick away her tears or lick her face when she wanted a kiss.

