Once upon a time, in a tiny village nestled in the mountains, there lived a little girl named Luna. Luna loved nothing more than to explore the woods that surrounded her village, discovering hidden waterfalls and secret meadows. One day, while wandering deeper into the woods than she'd ever been before, Luna stumbled upon a tiny, shimmering door hidden behind a tree.

